        "TileImage": "$($repository dcf91c29-56e2-4d9d-8f49-22dda6532027).Image",
        "Description": "You&apos;ve discovered a supervillain&apos;s secret lair! In an underground facility beneath a private island, you will find the HQ of the billionaire evil mastermind, Orson Williams. He has left his security behind to play a game of chess at his resort, so this will be our one shot at him! You will also need to infiltrate the facility to eliminate Williams&apos; mad scientist, Doctor Murphy, as well as his minion, Bob Schwab. Good luck, 47.",
